WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:06.756
Oh, my fuzzy cottontail.

00:00:06.756 --> 00:00:09.384
Do you think she’ll have my head for being late?

00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:10.384
No, I…

00:00:10.384 --> 00:00:11.761
I really must be, it’s time to…

00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:15.306
You think one of these cakes is magical?

00:00:15.306 --> 00:00:16.516
Not that one.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:19.185
Allow me to shield it from your eyes, Your Majesty. 

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:25.692
You were born in the jungle. You were raised by wolves. So cool, by the way. 

00:00:27.485 --> 00:00:28.319
Where’s Mowgli?

00:00:28.319 --> 00:00:30.572
Come with me, I’ll keep you safe!

00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:33.408
Wouldn’t you love to have a dog like this?

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:38.580
Look at her, to your left. No, not that far. Rotate your, ugh!

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.915
If you ever come to the jungle, you’ll be my guests. 

00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:44.169
Thanks, but no thanks. I’m an inside cat now.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:49.382
Have any special skills or talents?

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:50.842
Bull riding?  

00:00:52.677 --> 00:00:54.179
I’ll see you at high noon.  

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:59.642
Uh, can it be three thirty. After school. Please?

00:01:04.939 --> 00:01:08.109
Once again, the marshal needs his sidekick to save him from danger.

00:01:08.109 --> 00:01:09.736
I’m not his sidekick.

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:11.821
That’s right, I work alone.

00:01:11.821 --> 00:01:12.821
I’m his partner. 

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.743
I did not need your help.

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:18.036
Course not.

00:01:19.871 --> 00:01:21.581
What are these sparkles?

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:24.334
They’re memories left behind by other people.

00:01:24.334 --> 00:01:28.213
It’s so strange, I’ve never met anyone who could see the sparkles.

00:01:28.213 --> 00:01:29.964
That’s the part you find strange?

00:01:29.964 --> 00:01:32.050
Give me a break, you can talk to ghosts. 

00:01:33.551 --> 00:01:35.386
I wouldn’t believe anything that she tells you.

00:01:35.386 --> 00:01:37.388
These will be yummy.

00:01:37.388 --> 00:01:38.640
They do look good.

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:42.060
Wait, I thought Frankenstein was a monster?

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:43.478
You’ve seen him too?

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:50.568
The only way to make my creator remorseful is to destroy all of humanity.

00:01:50.568 --> 00:01:53.947
Okay, that’s a little much.

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:58.493
Where were you traveling from today when your cab broke down?

00:01:58.493 --> 00:02:02.163
Driving around town, going wherever the fare takes me.

00:02:02.163 --> 00:02:03.414
That’s helpful.

00:02:03.414 --> 00:02:06.084
What are your friends like? Are they talking bears?

00:02:06.084 --> 00:02:08.962
You sure have a colorful imagination, Donna.

00:02:11.172 --> 00:02:12.215
You’re alive?

00:02:12.215 --> 00:02:13.508
Yeah.

00:02:16.886 --> 00:02:19.806
If you don’t mind, I’m at a very exciting part.

00:02:20.765 --> 00:02:26.271
I figured it out. I’m a fictional character from a book written by an obscure writer and 
I’ve been brought here by your ghost friend. 

00:02:26.896 --> 00:02:29.399
I am a little bit disappointed that I am fictitious.

00:02:29.399 --> 00:02:31.067
You’ll always be real to us.

00:02:31.067 --> 00:02:31.860
Thank you.

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:38.992
My crew disappeared. I will need a new one.

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:41.703
This rat alone can’t run a ship.

00:02:42.954 --> 00:02:45.123
Who wants to walk the plank?

00:02:45.123 --> 00:02:46.123
Ahhh!

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:50.211
Thanks, buddy.

00:02:51.087 --> 00:02:54.632
I’m sorry for not being loyal to you, Santiago.

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:56.843
Pirates forever. 

00:03:02.599 --> 00:03:06.853
Why did Ghostwriter release these characters from the book? Maybe we need to ask! 

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:09.898
Ghostwriter, can you hear us?

00:03:09.898 --> 00:03:11.816
The ghost can’t but the whole city can!

